    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "שלם ישלם",
      "rationale": "Talɣa n usmgersed (infinitif absolu): lxlas ad yexles — snat n tikkal n yiwen n wawal, tettwaseḥrez deg tsuqilt."
    },
